      "content": "The damage you feel you've caused is real, and that pain is a huge burden to carry. It's a testament to your conscience that you feel this guilt so deeply. Instead of trying to undo the past, which is impossible, consider what small, meaningful actions you can take now to make things right or at least ease your own suffering. Sometimes, acknowledging the reality of the past while focusing on present amends is the only path forward.",
