    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont think making amends even helps. it just feels like a way to keep dragging it out. like, if i'm fundamentally broken, no amount of 'good deeds' is gonna fix that. it feels more like i'm just occupying space that could be used by someone who actually deserves to be here. does it ever stop feeling like you're just a mistake?",
